          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Farming Simulator 26 brings a new challenge system to virtual farmers who want to combine the relaxing experience, the series is known for, with some motivations to earn rewards. Whether you want to follow guided tasks or simply enjoy farm life at your own speed, the choice is yours.\n\nChoose what kind of farmer you want to be! Operate realistic tractors, harvesters, field sprayers, and other machines. Start logging with heavy forestry equipment, or tend to adorable farm animals like cows, sheep, chickens, goats, and their offspring.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Farming Simulator 26 introduce un nuevo sistema de desafíos para los agricultores virtuales que quieren combinar la experiencia relajante por la que es conocida la serie con algunos incentivos para ganar recompensas. Ya sea que quieras seguir tareas guiadas o simplemente disfrutar de la vida en la granja a tu propio ritmo, la elección es tuya.\n\n¡Elige qué tipo de agricultor quieres ser! Maneja tractores, cosechadoras, pulverizadores de campo y otras máquinas realistas. Empieza a talar con equipos forestales pesados, o cuida de animales de granja adorables como vacas, ovejas, gallinas, cabras y sus crías.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2026",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
